{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_snuff_wisp","model_identifier":"spell_snuff_wisp","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_snuff_wisp\n\nGoblin snuff wisp: a curl of grey-black smoke (a few dark cubes in a twisting line, about 24 u long) that flies from the caster to a light along -Z and smothers it. Origin at the head of the wisp.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -2..3, y -3..3, z -2..22 units (0.14 x 0.16 x 0.67 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 6.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 5 x 6 x 24 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 10\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `fly` | 0.8 | loop | the wisp twists and writhes as it flies (each curl rolls a little more than the one ahead) |\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n- Smoke cubes are not glowing (dark, unlit), so it reads as smoke in the dark.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"smoke0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.75,-0.25,-1.75],"to":[1.75,3.25,3.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.25,6.75,3.75,10.25],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[8.25,0.75,13.25,4.25],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.25,6.75,3.75,10.25],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[8.25,0.75,13.25,4.25],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.25,0.25,3.75,5.25],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.25,0.25,3.75,5.25],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"6e2f113c-8693-5878