|\n| `fly` | 0.8 | loop | the wisp twists and writhes as it flies (each curl rolls a little more than the one ahead) |\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n- Smoke cubes are not glowing (dark, unlit), so it reads as smoke in the dark.\n"}